## How to read it

Depths that are not a multiple of a tile (K + V stages) rotate a tile's K/V across slots. Look for the depth that wins at most L by more than the noise band; a depth that only wins inside ±{{ ctx.noise_pct }}% does not justify a change of default.

## Reproduce

```bash
mjolnir verify ring
mjolnir verify ring --base "--kv_format fp8" --stages "3 4 6"
```

